        "created_at": "2014-08-13T20:36:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Thanks Muchly. &nbsp;I made an expanded list for printing for reference, pasted here in case anyone else finds it useful.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li>Young Legacy</li></ul><ul><li>Rook City – The Wraith</li></ul><ul><li>Mad Bomber Blade Villain (Also in Oversized pack)</li></ul><ul><li>Cosmic Omnitron Villain&nbsp;<span>(Also in Oversized pack)</span>\n</li></ul><ul><li>Ra, Horus of Two Horizons</li></ul><ul><li>Redeemer Fanatic</li></ul><ul><li>Dark Visionary</li></ul><ul><li>Freedom Six Promo Pack (Contains 6 hero promos)</li></ul><ul><li>&nbsp; Team Leader Tachyon</li></ul><ul><li>&nbsp; Elemental Wrath Absolute Zero</li></ul><ul><li>&nbsp; Sacrifice Tempest</li></ul><ul><li>&nbsp; Last Stand Wraith</li></ul><ul><li>&nbsp; Golem Unity</li></ul><ul><li>&nbsp; Locomotion Bunker</li></ul><ul><li>The Eternal Haka</li></ul><ul><li>Dark Watch Promo Pack (Contains 4 hero promos and 2 villain promos)</li></ul><ul><li>&nbsp; Dark Watch Expatriette</li></ul><ul><li>&nbsp; Dark Watch Mr. Fixer</li></ul><ul><li>&nbsp; Dark Watch Nightmist</li></ul><ul><li>&nbsp; Dark Watch Setback</li></ul><ul><li>&nbsp; Agent of Gloom Spite</li></ul><ul><li>&nbsp; Skinwalker Gloomweaver</li></ul><ul><li>America's Greatest Legacy</li></ul><ul><li>G.I. Bunker</li></ul><ul><li>The Prime Wardens (Contains 5 hero promos) &nbsp;(Not yet out.)</li></ul>",
